#40001
On a secluded beach outside Sydney, Australia~
Loose `ysand`x lies in low ridges, scattered with shell chips worn smooth as
old teeth. Coarser grains scratch underfoot while the finer sand gives way and
settles again. Faint tracks lose definition at the edges, leaving the exposed
beach with a surface that never quite keeps a mark.`x
~
