#40007
an underwater passage~
Fine particles drift through the `bsubmerged water`x like dust in a room
without walls. Nearer shapes keep their edges for a moment, then dissolve into
blue-green distance. Sound loses direction in the enveloping water, and the
world beyond the surface feels impossibly remote.`x
~
