#40008
an underwater Grotto~
A small hollow lined with blue-gray shale lies beneath the left-hand water,
distinct from the surrounding sediment. Soft sediment gathers at the lower
edges of the submerged forms. Even the clearest shape seems held at a remove
by the layers between it and the surface.`x
~
