#40009
a sleeping alcove~
The `wbed`x lies off-center toward the right-hand side, balanced by a shallow
wall recess finished in honey-colored wood. A small fabric wall hanging has an
uneven lower edge, with a single thread curling away from the weave. The room
smells faintly of aired bedding, with a drier trace of wood beneath it.`x
~
