#40010
Novamilia Estate~
The `wsofa`x sits at a slight angle to the near wall, breaking up the straight
lines of the cream plaster trim. A little shelf holds an arrangement of
ordinary ornaments chosen for color rather than symmetry. Small sounds lose
their sharpness among the soft furnishings, giving a conversation room to slow
down.`x
~
